   <section xreflabel="EventDelivery"
            role="class"
            xml:id="org.osgi.service.event.propertytypes.EventDelivery">
      <title>@EventDelivery</title>
      <para>
Component Property Type for the <link linkend="org.osgi.service.event.EventConstants.EVENT_DELIVERY">EventConstants.EVENT_DELIVERY</link> service
 property of an <link linkend="org.osgi.service.event.EventHandler">EventHandler</link> service.
 </para>
      <para>
 This annotation can be used on an <link linkend="org.osgi.service.event.EventHandler">EventHandler</link> component to declare
 the value of the <link linkend="org.osgi.service.event.EventConstants.EVENT_DELIVERY">EventConstants.EVENT_DELIVERY</link> service property.</para>
      <formalpara role="parameter">
         <title>See Also</title>
         <para>
            <code>Component Property Types</code>
         </para>
      </formalpara>
      <formalpara role="parameter">
         <title>Since</title>
         <para>1.4</para>
      </formalpara>
      <formalpara role="parameter">
         <title>Retention</title>
         <para>
            <code>CLASS</code>
         </para>
      </formalpara>
      <formalpara role="parameter">
         <title>Target</title>
         <para>
            <code>TYPE</code>
         </para>
      </formalpara>
      <section xreflabel="value"
               role="method"
               xml:id="org.osgi.service.event.propertytypes.EventDelivery.value--">
         <title>String[] value</title>
         <para role="description">
Service property specifying the <code>Event</code> delivery qualities
 requested by an <link linkend="org.osgi.service.event.EventHandler">EventHandler</link> service.
 </para>
         <para>
 The supported delivery qualities are:
 </para>
         <itemizedlist>
            <listitem>
               <para>
                  <link linkend="org.osgi.service.event.EventConstants.DELIVERY_ASYNC_ORDERED">EventConstants.DELIVERY_ASYNC_ORDERED</link>
               </para>
            </listitem>
            <listitem>
               <para>
                  <link linkend="org.osgi.service.event.EventConstants.DELIVERY_ASYNC_UNORDERED">EventConstants.DELIVERY_ASYNC_UNORDERED</link>}</para>
            </listitem>
         </itemizedlist>
         <formalpara role="parameter">
            <title>Returns</title>
            <para>The requested event delivery qualities.</para>
         </formalpara>
         <formalpara role="parameter">
            <title>See Also</title>
            <para>
               <link linkend="org.osgi.service.event.EventConstants.EVENT_DELIVERY">EventConstants.EVENT_DELIVERY</link>
            </para>
         </formalpara>
      </section>
   </section>
